     A                                  1  2'This release action is insisted up-
     A                                      on by corporate accounting and audi-
     A                                      ting. Any'
     A                                  2  1'deviation of this policy will resu-
     A                                      lt in the MMIS requisition program'
     A                                  2 70'being'
     A                                  3  1'removed from the violating plant.'
     A                                  5  1'For unapproved work orders, if the'
     A                                  5 36'user needs to get a coded non-stoc-
     A                                      k item on'
     A                                  6  1'order immediately, the "ACCEPT GEN'
     A                                  6 36'REQ" function key should be depres-
     A                                      sed. This'
     A                                  7  1'will cause a requisition number to'
     A                                  7 36'be assigned to this item and will'
     A                                  7 70'also print'
     A                                  8  1'the worksheet along with a hardcop-
     A                                      y of the requisition. This package'
     A                                  8 70'will then'
     A                                  9  1'be routed for approval. Upon appro-
     A                                      val, the engineering control point'
     A                                  9 70'will'
     A                                 10  1'update the work order and release'
     A                                 10 35'the specific requisition to purcha-
     A                                      sing for'
     A                                 11  1'processing. If other coded non-sto-
     A                                      ck items for this work order are pr-
     A                                      ocessed'
     A                                 12  1'using the normal mode (depressing'
     A                                 12 35'function key "ACCEPT SCREEN"), the'
     A                                 12 70'worksheet'
     A                                 13  1'requisition package will not inclu-
     A                                      de hardcopy requisitions for items'
     A                                 13 70'that have'
     A                                 14  1'already been processed using the "-
     A                                      ACCEPT GEN REQ" function key.'
     A                                 16  1'For approved work orders, depressi-
     A                                      ng the "ACCEPT GEN REQ" function ke-
     A                                      y will'
     A                                 17  1'cause a requisition number to be a-
     A                                      ssigned to the coded non-stock item-
     A                                      . It will'
     A                                 18  1'also cause a hardcopy requisition'
     A                                 18 35'to be printed without a worksheet'
     A                                 18 69'requisition'
     A                                 19  1'package. This requisition must be'
     A                                 19 35'approved before the engineering co-
     A                                      ntrol point'
     A                                 20  1'can release it to purchasing for p-
     A                                      rocessing.'
