     A                                  1  2'Materials control can process the -
     A                                      requisition and transmit it to purc-
     A                                      hasing or'
     A                                  2  1'they can elect to change the statu-
     A                                      s of the item to an "R". This can'
     A                                  2 69'be done for'
     A                                  3  1'several reasons: the coded stock i-
     A                                      tem might be in an overstock condit-
     A                                      ion or it'
     A                                  4  1'may be an item that no longer will'
     A                                  4 36'be a stock item and the storeroom'
     A                                  4 70'wants to'
     A                                  5  1'get rid of the material on hand. M-
     A                                      aterials control cannot split a req-
     A                                      uisition'
     A                                  6  1'(i.e. having part on order and par-
     A                                      t on reserve). Whenever materials'
     A                                  6 69'control'
     A                                  7  1'changes the status of "M" to "R",'
     A                                  7 35'the item will disappear from the w-
     A                                      ork order'
     A                                  8  1'purchase material display and reap-
     A                                      pear on the work order non-purchase-
     A                                      d material'
     A                                  9  1'display.'
