     A                                  1  2'Changes to the following fields fo-
     A                                      r coded stock items are only permit-
     A                                      ted prior'
     A                                  2  1'to the approval of the work order:'
     A                                  4 10'- QTY'
     A                                  4 30'- STG'
     A                                  4 48'- ADDITIONAL INFO'
     A                                  5 10'- UM'
     A                                  5 30'- ORIG'
     A                                  5 48'- SUGGESTED VENDOR'
     A                                  6 10'- PRIME'
     A                                  6 30'- DATE REQ"D      - REMARKS'
     A                                  8  1'Uncoded Items'
     A                                  9  1'-------------'
     A                                 10  1'Prior to work order approval the m-
     A                                      aterial status codes of "M" and "X"-
     A                                       can be'
     A                                 11  1'changed. The change will not affec-
     A                                      t the estimate totals since both al-
     A                                      ready'
     A                                 12  1'exist in the purchased material es-
     A                                      timate. After the work order is app-
     A                                      roved,'
     A                                 13  1'items with an "M" material status'
     A                                 13 35'code cannot have their material st-
     A                                      atus codes'
     A                                 14  1'changed. Items with an "X" materia-
     A                                      l status code can be changed to an'
     A                                 14 70'"M"'
     A                                 15  1'material status code. The fields t-
     A                                      hat can be changed are as follows:'
     A                                 17 10'- QTY'
     A                                 17 30'- SUB'
     A                                 17 48'- ADDITIONAL INFO'
     A                                 18 10'- UM'
     A                                 18 30'- STG'
     A                                 18 48'- SUGGESTED VENDOR'
     A                                 19 10'- UNIT PRICE'
     A                                 19 30'- ORIG'
     A                                 19 48'- DESCRIPTION'
     A                                 20 10'- PRIME'
