     A                                      CF01
     A                                  1  2'Changes made prior to the approval-
     A                                      of the work order will be reflected-
     A                                       in the'
     A                                  2  1'work order estimate. Changes made'
     A                                  2 35'after the work order is approved w-
     A                                      ill have no'
     A                                  3  1'effect on the work order estimate.'
     A                                  3 36'Items that are released to purchas-
     A                                      ing cannot'
     A                                  4  1'be changed.'
     A                                  6  1'Coded Non-stock Items'
     A                                  7  1'---------------------'
     A                                  8  1'Prior to work order approval, the'
     A                                  8 35'material status codes of "M" and "-
     A                                      X" can'
     A                                  9  1'be changed. The change will not af-
     A                                      fect the estimate totals since both-
     A                                       already'
     A                                 10  1'exist in the purchased material es-
     A                                      timate. After the work order is app-
     A                                      roved,'
     A                                 11  1'items with an "X" material status'
     A                                 11 35'code can be changed to an "M" mate-
     A                                      rial'
     A                                 12  1'status code. Changes can be made b-
     A                                      efore and after the work order is'
     A                                 12 69'approved.'
     A                                 13  1'The fields permitted to be changed'
     A                                 13 36'are as follows:'
     A                                 15  8'- QTY'
     A                                 15 30'- STG'
     A                                 15 51'- ADDITIONAL INFO'
     A                                 16  8'- CODE'
     A                                 16 30'- ORIG'
