     A                                  7  1'Throughout this HELP function, mat-
     A                                      erial will be referred to as coded'
     A                                  7 70'stock,'
     A                                  8  1'coded non-stock, and uncoded. Code-
     A                                      d stock refers to material that has-
     A                                       been'
     A                                  9  1'CSIS-coded and is maintained in th-
     A                                      e storeroom. Coded non-stock items'
     A                                  9 70'refer'
     A                                 10  1'to material that has been CSIS-cod-
     A                                      ed but are not maintained in the st-
     A                                      oreroom.'
     A                                 11  1'Uncoded items refer to material th-
     A                                      at has neither been CSIS-coded nor'
     A                                 11 70'are'
     A                                 12  1'maintained in the storeroom.'
